# Findings agent-drift should stay quiet about.
#
#   value            mute this finding everywhere
#   file::value      mute it in one instruction file only
#   skip: <glob>     do not check a whole instruction file
#
# Glob patterns work. Only put DELIBERATE things here: examples, historical
# mentions, external addresses. If you are tempted to mute a genuine breakage,
# fix the instructions instead.
#
# Health check: if this file keeps growing while accuracy stays flat, the
# filters are wrong — fix the detector, not this list.

# The fixture repo is meant to contain broken paths.
skip: tests/fixtures/**
